<title>UK: Sweden sets 300 million French franc 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 300 million French franc 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN, KINGDOM OF</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN FFR   BASE	*3M-PIBOR  MATURITY  **03.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +30 BP    PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA+	 REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALLABLE FROM 03.JUL.98 AT PAR.</p>
<p>	     *CAPPED AT 7.5 PCT</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
